557
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:16,740
Three, two, one. Open your eyes.

558
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:18,910
(This time, I'm taking back
what's mine)

559
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:26,600
You're shucking corn
to hide how nervous you are.

560
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:28,240
He's not nervous anymore.

561
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,040
What's he got to be nervous about?

562
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,160
Even if he's the Killer,

563
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,240
he's got nothing to worry about.

564
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,780
(Totally unbothered)
Why would I be nervous if I'm the Killer?

565
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,130
Air that exactly as it is.

566
00:18:34,130 --> 00:18:35,630
(Never seen a Killer this cocky)

567
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,510
Look at him brag.

568
00:18:36,670 --> 00:18:38,470
(Hehe)

569
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:39,320
Pretty little dummy.

570
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,510
(Two corn kernels =
Eliminate number two)

571
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:45,680
(Okay. I got it)

572
00:18:45,730 --> 00:18:47,850
(Saw the whole thing)

573
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:49,400
(You're acting suspicious)

574
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,320
Are you out yet?

575
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:50,960
Nope.

576
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,880
Guess I'm next, huh?

577
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,240
(Figured it all out)
Let's see if you've got the guts

578
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,200
to shoot me right now.

579
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:01,740
(Lost in his singing)

580
00:19:04,490 --> 00:19:07,120
(Pointing right at the target)

581
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:11,330
(Bro, you can do that?)

582
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:15,840
(Chengcheng, your boss needs you)

583
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:16,520
Over here.

584
00:19:17,630 --> 00:19:20,800
(No rush. Let's have more fun)

585
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:26,970
(Running out of ideas)

586
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:29,890
(Clarifying the target again)

587
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:33,150
(I'll make my move when I want)

588
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:37,000
(Getting impatient)
Churan, hurry up. It's getting dark.

589
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:38,280
(Finally getting to work)
Hu Xianxu, you're out!

590
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,480
Hu Xianxu, you're out!

591
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:42,700
Hu Xianxu's eliminated.

592
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:44,240
(Hu Xianxu eliminated)

593
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:45,960
Boss and Killer, mission accomplished.

594
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:48,080
(I'm just that good)
Now vote to identify the Boss.

595
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:48,920
Vote!

596
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:49,840
Vote!

597
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:53,560
(The hunt is on)
Bing, Teng, me, Churan...

598
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:54,680
It's gotta be Teng.

599
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:55,920
I think it's Anyu.

600
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:57,840
What?

601
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:59,090
(Did I hear that right?)

602
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:01,760
He's been really active this round.

603
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:02,560
I've been really active?

604
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:04,680
I kinda suspect Anyu too.

605
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,200
What did I do?

606
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:07,200
Kill.

607
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:08,920
Don't kill.

608
00:20:09,810 --> 00:20:10,600
(Same gesture as the Killer)

609
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:11,000
Kill.

610
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:12,840
Don't kill.

611
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,600
That's exactly the same hand gesture

612
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:16,150
Anyu's making.

613
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:17,440
(Caught you)

614
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:18,360
Look, you're doing it right now.

615
00:20:19,530 --> 00:20:22,110
(How about now?)

616
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:22,920
There's evidence.

617
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:25,720
I won't say it.

618
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:26,560
I've got evidence too.

619
00:20:26,950 --> 00:20:28,830
(Let's hear it)

620
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,280
Because I saw Teng...

621
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,360
Teng was...

622
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:35,330
gesturing behind his back,
pointing someone out.

623
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:37,290
(This isn't looking good)

624
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:41,120
Surely he wouldn't be that obvious?

625
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:42,440
But doesn't Teng always do that?

626
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,000
Yeah, he does.

627
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:45,760
(Always making eye contact with the Killer)
He does that every round.

628
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:48,720
(Churan, thank goodness you're here)
So what was the point of saying that?

629
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:51,760
But Hu really was the one eliminated.

630
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:55,560
(Gotta come up with another story)

631
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:57,040
Then it's Teng.

632
00:20:58,190 --> 00:20:59,610
(Having second thoughts)

633
00:20:59,840 --> 00:21:01,080
I think it's Teng.

634
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,520
What about Churan?

635
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:04,950
I think it's Anyu.

636
00:21:04,950 --> 00:21:06,450
(Having doubts again)

637
00:21:06,450 --> 00:21:07,320
Why?

638
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:09,680
What did I do to make you suspect me?

639
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:12,200
He kept looking up
at the sky this round.

640
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:16,710
(Who's up there anyway?)

641
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,000
Stop staring at the sky, okay?

642
00:21:19,090 --> 00:21:21,460
(Just smile and let it go)

643
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:24,360
One, two, three, four, five, six.

644
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:27,160
(Remaining players)
We've got one, three, five, and six.

645
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:27,920
One, three, five, six.

646
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:28,640
Three, five, six?

647
00:21:29,280 --> 00:21:30,240
Three, five, six, Bai.

648
00:21:31,270 --> 00:21:31,970
(I'm still involved?)

649
00:21:32,120 --> 00:21:32,960
(Remaining players)
I'm number seven.

650
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:33,880
Three, five, seven.

651
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:35,400
Shouldn't have reminded you guys.

652
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,840
Shouldn't have reminded you?

653
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:40,360
That's a strange thing to say.

654
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:40,860
(You're acting suspicious)

655
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:43,720
Wait.

656
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:45,070
(Could it be?)

657
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:46,400
Something feels off.

658
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,560
(And just like that, a new twist)
Could it be Churan?

659
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,600
(Time to vote)
Three, two, one. Vote.

660
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:55,080
(Shen Teng eliminated.
Wang Churan: 2, abstained: 3, Shen Teng: 3)

661
00:21:55,120 --> 00:21:55,760
What?

662
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:57,560
Teng's eliminated.

663
00:21:58,540 --> 00:22:00,000
(Good news: The company's gone bust)

664
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:01,040
You guys voted for me?

665
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:02,130
(Such an innocent kid)

666
00:22:02,760 --> 00:22:04,840
(You're going down with me)

667
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:06,240
It's okay.

668
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,180
You got it right.

669
00:22:07,180 --> 00:22:08,640
(You're coming too)

670
00:22:09,300 --> 00:22:10,470
(Just teasing the kids)

671
00:22:10,680 --> 00:22:11,680
We got it right?

672
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:12,680
Of course you did.

673
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:17,000
I tossed two corn kernels your way.

674
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,680
(Just messing with you)
I thought you'd get it right away.

675
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:20,680
I was being

676
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,520
so obvious.

677
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:22,840
Teng kept doing this

678
00:22:22,840 --> 00:22:23,560
with his hand.

679
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:24,960
I just kept watching him.

680
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:26,400
(Bro wasn't even trying to hide it)
I was like...

681
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:28,000
Teng, since when have you ever

682
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:28,760
vibed with my music?

683
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:30,200
That's what cracked me up even more!

684
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,960
I'm rapping, and he's over there...

685
00:22:32,450 --> 00:22:34,790
(100% match)

686
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:40,560
So cute.
